        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "1eb55dd0-b496-5bd0-83fa-858787b82b0a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: psilocybin, psilocin, baeocystin, LSD, mescaline, DMT\n- Systems: Psilocybe genus, the human body\n- Concepts: psychedelic compounds, psychoactive effects, prodrugs, mind-altering effects\n\nFacts:\n- In many species of the Psilocybe genus, psilocybin, psilocin, and baeocystin are the main psychedelic compounds responsible for psychoactive effects.\n- Psilocybin is a prodrug that is quickly converted by the human body into psilocin.\n- Psilocin has mind-altering effects that are similar in some respects to the effects of LSD, mescaline, and DMT.",
